## About the environment

These pairs did not check at the pin. `environment-mismatch`: the pair does not check at the pin and does check at the
declared revision, so the method attributes it to the difference between the pin and the declared revision.
`environment-undeclared`: no comparison with the declared revision exists, because {undeclared}, so no cause is
attributed.
Both are facts about a dataset and a pair of environments; neither enters any rate about the mathematics, and neither
says anything about how the entry was written.

